      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnetic entropy change near the transition in the 2–5 at.% Pd alloys will be roughly comparable to that of undoped MnNiSi.",
